OL,3,AParty Rock Anthem singer struggled with
OL,4,Amental health before death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British singer who was a member of
OL,7,Fthe girl group G.R.L took her own life,
OL,8,Fan inquest has found.
OL,10,FLauren Bennett, 36, who also featured
OL,11,Fon LMFAO's 2011 hit Party Rock Anthem,
OL,12,Fwas found dead in Kent on 29 May.
OL,14,FIn a statement read out by an assistant
OL,15,Fcoroner on Friday, her husband Kenny
OL,16,FWormald said she had been struggling
OL,17,Fwith severe mental health issues before
OL,18,Fher death.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
